STEP 0 survives, but only as Track B. The scalable native object is Proposition 7.1’s binary form of degree \(2k-1\): its unique rank-\(k\) weighted Veronese decomposition can be planted by construction and checked by exact finite-field expansion. The honest general recovery method is Prony/Hankel reconstruction plus finite-field polynomial root finding, polynomial-time; the candidate benchmark will therefore measure the gap between that mechanical route and a short cyclic-subgroup invariant, not claim structural intractability.
  → Finish Track B construction design and validate finite-field parameters against Proposition 7.1
  • Implement the deterministic generator, parser, verifier, attacks, reference solver, canonicalization, and selftest
  • Run and fix all mandatory gates; measure shipping costs and answer caps
  • Run the bare and G9 hardening arms, then align shipping preset and reports
  • Write README.md and deliver the complete evidence bundle
